@startuml
' Palette: usecase; based on the Visual Paradigm guide samples (see README).
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam ActorBorderColor #222222
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9D9
skinparam NoteBorderColor #555555
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor white
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #222222
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor #222222
skinparam RectangleBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #222222
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40
top to bottom direction
actor Teacher
rectangle "StudyFlow — Teacher" #7ACFF5 {
usecase "Tạo / quản lý\nCourse Offering" as course
usecase "Quản lý join code" as code
usecase "Duyệt / từ chối\nyêu cầu tham gia" as enrollment
usecase "Quản lý thành viên lớp" as members
usecase "Upload PDF / PPTX" as upload
usecase "Theo dõi xử lý PPTX" as processing
usecase "Công bố học liệu" as publish
usecase "Thu hồi công bố" as revoke
course -[hidden]down-> code
code -[hidden]down-> enrollment
enrollment -[hidden]down-> members
upload -[hidden]down-> processing
processing -[hidden]down-> publish
publish -[hidden]down-> revoke
members -[hidden]down-> upload
}
Teacher -right- course
Teacher -[norank]- code
Teacher -[norank]- enrollment
Teacher -[norank]- members
Teacher -[norank]- upload
Teacher -[norank]- processing
Teacher -[norank]- publish
Teacher -[norank]- revoke
note bottom of publish
Chỉ quản lý lớp/học liệu thuộc Teacher.
PPTX READY mới được công bố.
Upload, công bố và thu hồi là các mục tiêu độc lập.
end note
@enduml
